    <scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
      <head>Scope and Content
</head>

<p>This collection contains files created and used by the Assistant State Librarian of the Library of Virginia, when it was referred to as the Virginia State Library, or the Virginia State Library and Archives. Nolan Yelich held the position of Assistant State Librarian for several years before becoming the State Librarian in 1995. The material is arranged according to subject, with the most notable being Library Board meeting minutes and correspondence, information on the Library Services and Construction Act (LSCA) and Advisory Council, the Cooperative Programs Committee, the Richmond Area Library Cooperative, and the State Networking Users Advisory Council. Various networking studies and folders of general correspondence are included as well.</p>

      


    </scopecontent>


